{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1447334-question-about-helios\u2019-judgement","id":1447334,"title":"Question about Helios\u2019 Judgement","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-03T21:13:42-07:00","id":1447334,"title":"Question about Helios\u2019 Judgement","content":"Hello there. <br /> <br /> The dice pool to activate Helios\u2019 Judgment, a Royal Summer Contract, is Dexterity + Athletics + Mantle, and it counts as an Instant action. Is the activation roll also the attack roll? <br /> <br /> Or do I first roll to activate the Contract, and then make a second roll (Athletics + Dex) for the attack? If that\u2019s the case, then do the activation and attack both happen in the same Turn? Or do I spend one Turn activating the Contract, and the next Turn throwing the sunbeam?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25750,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25750-holy-hell-thats-hot","user":"Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot","date":". 05-04-2021, 12:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25750-holy-hell-thats-hot","name":"Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T21:49:05-07:00","id":1447341,"title":"","content":"The activation roll gives you access to the weapon described in its Success text. The attack roll is Dexterity + Athletics - Defense, as any other Thrown Attack would be.<br /> <br /> The Contract's activation roll is an Instant action and an attack roll is an Instant action, so you cannot attack at the same time as you use the Contract unless you invoke the Contract reflexively by both spending Glamour and fulfilling the Loophole.<br /> <br /> You spend a turn arming yourself and then, as described, you have access to a thrown weapon that returns to your hand at the beginning of each turn for the duration of the Contract (which, as no Duration section is listed, defaults to one scene, as stated at the start of the section on how Contracts work).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T21:51:26-07:00","id":1447342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1447334-question-about-helios\u2019-judgement?p=1447341#post1447341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The activation roll gives you access to the weapon described in its Success text. The attack roll is Dexterity + Athletics - Defense, as any other Thrown Attack would be.<br /> <br /> The Contract's activation roll is an Instant action and an attack roll is an Instant action, so you cannot attack at the same time as you use the Contract unless you invoke the Contract reflexively by both spending Glamour and fulfilling the Loophole.<br /> <br /> You spend a turn arming yourself and then, as described, you have access to a thrown weapon that returns to your hand at the beginning of each turn for the duration of the Contract (which, as no Duration section is listed, defaults to one scene, as stated at the start of the section on how Contracts work).</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, thank you. That\u2019s what I figured. Just wanted to be sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25750-holy-hell-thats-hot","name":"Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T21:53:09-07:00","id":1447343,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I have one more related question. It says that you can spend a point of Willpower to make the Contract\u2019s damage aggravated. I\u2019m assuming that\u2019s only for a single Turn, correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25750,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25750-holy-hell-thats-hot","user":"Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot","date":". 05-04-2021, 12:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25750-holy-hell-thats-hot","name":"Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T22:07:06-07:00","id":1447345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Holy-Hell-Thats-Hot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1447334-question-about-helios\u2019-judgement?p=1447343#post1447343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry, I have one more related question. It says that you can spend a point of Willpower to make the Contract\u2019s damage aggravated. I\u2019m assuming that\u2019s only for a single Turn, correct?</div> </div> </div> </div>It comes after the description where the lethal damage is part of the regular statblock and the Contract doesn't function indoors, so I can't think of much reason for the damage boost to be time-limited in that fashion, no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}